    "summary": "A pair of leggings (?) (more likely), or sleeves (?) made of fish skin.  Tapered, with a semi-circular top.  Dyed blue, the lower third darker than the upper part, yellow towards the bottom.  Decorated with finely cut and stitched appliqué, circular in shape, with scrolls; made of white fish skin.  Much smaller appliqué motifs below.  Lined with natural cream tabby linen cloth.  Small holes.",
